cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ResistaMet GUI: An Open-Source Electrical Measurement Suite for Keithley Sourcemeters"
abstract: >
  ResistaMet GUI is a PyQt5 desktop application for electrical characterization
  using Keithley 2400/2450 sourcemeters. It provides resistance, voltage-source,
  current-source, four-point probe, and hardware-driven I-V sweep measurement
  modes with real-time visualization, multi-spot four-point probe analysis with
  current-reversal (delta) mode, and dual-format JSON+CSV data export with
  crash recovery.
